5. Group-Based Metrics (to handle categorical effects):
   - groupbythenstd(spectral_stability_interaction, nO): Variability of stability interaction grouped by oxygen count.
   - groupbythenmean(oxygen_density, nN): Average oxygen density grouped by nitrogen count.

These transformations will emphasize meaningful biodegradability-related patterns, reduce noise from skewness, and normalize feature variability for improved classification performance.
